### List bookings
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings?page=1&limit=10

### Search bookings
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings?q=DKBO-1001

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings/bookings-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "DKBO-1002",
  "customer": "Diya Patel",
  "show": "Golden Hour 9PM",
  "tickets": 4,
  "amount": 249,
  "status": "pending"
}
